When I filled all the information, I was told the server was not available.
Fxxk EA.

I totally recommend this game.
PRO:
- length and variety of different campaigns (you can play greenskins' campaign right after having played the dwarven one and feel a totally different campaign, even though these two are the two main nemesis in both campaigns);
- research and building trees are DEEP;
- different soldiers' skin within the same unit;
- heros' skills tree are different (not too much) from each other;
- occasional events are really fun;
- units fighting don't look like a glob of pixels (TW: warhammer 2 cough...cough..)
CONS:
- blood and gore should be standard, not a paid DLC;
- drop of frame rate occurs in battle modes skirmishes where full armies clashes;
